{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "edyone-lms-auth-collection",
    "name": "Edyone LMS — Auth & Legal APIs",
    "description": "Authentication, password management, and legal document endpoints for Edyone LMS v1 API.\n\n**Base URL variable:** `{{baseUrl}}` — set to your environment (e.g. https://edyonelms.in/api or http://localhost:8000/api)\n\n**Auth variable:** `{{token}}` — captured automatically by Login requests via the test script.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Student Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', json.data.user.id);",
                  "        console.log('Student token saved');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"admission_number\": \"ADM001\",\n  \"password\": \"Student@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/user/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "user", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login as a student using admission number and password.\n\n**Request body:**\n- `admission_number` (required, string)\n- `password` (required, string)\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"message\": \"Login successful\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"user\": { ... },\n    \"token\": \"...\",\n    \"token_type\": \"Bearer\"\n  }\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Teacher Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', json.data.user.id);",
                  "        console.log('Teacher token saved');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"teacher@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Teacher@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/teacher/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "teacher", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login as a teacher using email and password.\n\n**Request body:**\n- `email` (required, valid email)\n- `password` (required, string)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Password Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password (Send OTP)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.user_id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('reset_user_id', json.data.user_id);",
                  "        console.log('Reset user_id saved: ' + json.data.user_id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "forgot-password"]
            },
            "description": "Send a 6-digit OTP to the user's email address. OTP is valid for **2 minutes**.\n\n**Request body:**\n- `email` (required, valid email)\n\n**Response includes:**\n- `user_id` — to be used in Verify OTP\n- `email`\n- `expires_in` (seconds)\n\nOTP is delivered via ZeptoMail template configured in `services.zeptomail.otp_template_key`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": {{reset_user_id}},\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/verify-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "verify-otp"]
            },
            "description": "Verify the 6-digit OTP sent to user's email.\n\n**Request body:**\n- `user_id` (required, numeric) — from Forgot Password response\n- `otp` (required, 6 digits)\n\nAfter successful verification, OTP is cleared from DB and user can proceed to `change-password`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": {{reset_user_id}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/resend-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "resend-otp"]
            },
            "description": "Resend OTP to user's email. **120-second cooldown** applies between resends.\n\n**Request body:**\n- `user_id` (required, numeric)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password (after OTP verify)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": {{reset_user_id}},\n  \"password\": \"NewPass@123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"NewPass@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/change-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "change-password"]
            },
            "description": "Set new password after OTP verification (forgot password flow).\n\n**Request body:**\n- `user_id` (required, numeric)\n- `password` (required, min 8 chars, must contain lowercase, uppercase, number, special char)\n- `password_confirmation` (required, must match `password`)\n\n**Important:** OTP must be verified (via `verify-otp`) before calling this. Returns a fresh auth token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Password (authenticated)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"current_password\": \"Current@123\",\n  \"new_password\": \"NewPass@456\",\n  \"new_password_confirmation\": \"NewPass@456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/update-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "update-password"]
            },
            "description": "Update password while logged in. Requires current password.\n\n**Headers:** `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n\n**Request body:**\n- `current_password` (required)\n- `new_password` (required, same complexity rules as Change Password)\n- `new_password_confirmation` (required, must match)\n\nAll existing tokens are revoked and a new one is issued."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Profile",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Student Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/user/profile",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "user", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "**Authenticated (student).** Returns full student profile in 6 grouped sections:\n\n**1. personal_info** — student_detail_id, user_id, full_name, email, mobile_number, phone, dob, gender, religion, aadhar_no, appar_id, registration_number, image, is_active, role\n\n**2. family_info** — father_name, mother_name\n\n**3. address_info** — local_address, permanent_address, city, state, pincode\n\n**4. academic_info** — admission_no, date_of_admission, roll_no, board, standard_id, standard_name, standard_code, section_id, section_name\n\n**5. transport_info** — transportation_required, active_transport (vehicle_no, route, pickup_point, is_active)\n\n**6. organization_info** — organization_id, name, code, logo_url"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Teacher Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/teacher/profile",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "teacher", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "**Authenticated (teacher).** Returns full teacher profile in 5 grouped sections:\n\n**1. personal_info** — teacher_detail_id, user_id, name, email, mobile_number, phone, emergency_contact, gender, dob, image, role, is_active\n\n**2. professional_info** — employee_id, date_of_joining, qualification, total_subjects_assigned, total_classes_assigned, total_sections_assigned\n\n**3. address_info** — address, city, state, pincode\n\n**4. assignments** — `subjects[]` (subject_id, subject_name, subject_code, standard_id, standard_name, section_id, section_name), `classes[]` (standard_id, standard_name, section_id, section_name), `sections[]` (section_id, section_name, standard_id, standard_name), `summary` (total_assignments, has_data)\n\n**5. organization_info** — organization_id, name, code, logo_url"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. App Info",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "About App",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/about-app",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "about-app"]
            },
            "description": "**Authenticated.** Returns app information: heading, sub-heading, logo, content sections, contact details, address, core team, social media links, and documents (PDF/DOC uploads on S3).\n\n**Headers:** `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "School Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/school-info",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "school-info"]
            },
            "description": "**Authenticated.** Returns school information for the logged-in user's organization: about school, vision/mission/values/goals, mobile, email, address, website, management team (with photos), and documents.\n\n**Headers:** `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Switch Account (Multi-Account)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Add Account (Login + Snapshot)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('added_token', json.data.token);",
                  "        console.log('Added account token saved');",
                  "        console.log('Snapshot:', JSON.stringify(json.data.snapshot, null, 2));",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login_type\": \"student\",\n  \"admission_number\": \"ADM001\",\n  \"password\": \"Student@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/switch-account/add",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "switch-account", "add"]
            },
            "description": "**Public.** Log in with credentials and return enriched profile snapshot for app's local 'added accounts' list.\n\n**Request body (student):**\n```json\n{\n  \"login_type\": \"student\",\n  \"admission_number\": \"ADM001\",\n  \"password\": \"Student@123\"\n}\n```\n\n**Request body (teacher):**\n```json\n{\n  \"login_type\": \"teacher\",\n  \"email\": \"teacher@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Teacher@123\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response:** `{ user, token, token_type, snapshot }`\n\n**Snapshot fields (for switcher UI):**\n- `user_id`, `name`, `email`, `role`, `role_label` (Student/Teacher)\n- `image` (profile pic URL)\n- `organization` `{ id, name, logo }`\n- `class_info` for students: `{ admission_no, roll_no, standard_id, standard_name, section_id, section_name, class_display }`\n- `class_info` for teachers: `{ employee_id, qualification, class_display }`\n\n**App flow:**\n1. User taps 'Add Account' in switcher\n2. App calls this endpoint with new credentials\n3. App stores `{ token, snapshot }` in local storage\n4. App displays all stored snapshots as cards in switcher UI"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Profile Snapshot (Refresh card)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/switch-account/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "switch-account", "me"]
            },
            "description": "**Authenticated.** Returns compact profile snapshot for the currently authenticated user.\n\n**Use case:** App periodically calls this for each stored token to refresh the snapshot (so the switcher shows the latest name / image / class after admin updates).\n\n**Returns:** same `snapshot` shape as Add Account response."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Account (Revoke token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{added_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/switch-account/remove",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "switch-account", "remove"]
            },
            "description": "**Authenticated.** Revokes ONLY the current access token (the one in the Authorization header).\n\n**Use case:** User removes an account from the device switcher. App sends this with the token-to-remove in Authorization, server revokes only that token (other linked accounts keep working).\n\n**App flow:**\n1. User taps the X / Remove icon on an account card in switcher\n2. App calls this with `Authorization: Bearer <that-account-token>`\n3. On success, app deletes the stored `{ token, snapshot }` entry locally\n\nNote: tries `{{added_token}}` for testing — switch this header to the specific account's token in production."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cross-Org Accounts (Auto-discovery)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/switch-account/schools",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "switch-account", "schools"]
            },
            "description": "**Authenticated.** Auto-discovers all accounts sharing the current user's email + role across organizations.\n\nUseful when a user (same email) is enrolled in multiple schools — they can see all linked schools without manually adding each one.\n\n**Returns:** array of `{ user_id, organization_id, is_current, school: { id, name, logo, active } }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Switch to Org",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"organization_id\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/switch-account/switch",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "switch-account", "switch"]
            },
            "description": "**Authenticated.** Revokes current token and issues a new one for the same user-email in a different organization (used with the auto-discovery flow `/switch-account/schools`).\n\n**Body:** `{ organization_id }`\n\n**Returns:** new token + user data."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Contact School (Student & Teacher)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Student → Submit Contact",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
